OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch inquiry after two
OL,4,Ainmates die in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo inmates have died in custody at a
OL,7,Fprison in Nottinghamshire.
OL,9,FThe Ministry of Justice (MoJ) confirmed
OL,10,Ftwo men died at HMP Ranby - a Category
OL,11,FC training and resettlement prison near
OL,12,FRetford - on Wednesday.
OL,14,FNottinghamshire Police said it was
OL,15,Fworking with the Prison Service to
OL,16,Festablish the circumstances around the
OL,17,Fdeaths.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
