OL,3,GNEWSAPolice launch inquiry after two
OL,4,Ainmates die in prison
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for the Prison Service:
OL,7,F"As with all deaths in custody, the
OL,8,FPrisons and Probation Ombudsman will
OL,9,Finvestigate, and we will respond to its
OL,10,Ffindings in due course."
